{"id":"4366f310672969df","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-projector-valued.md","title":"Projection-Valued Measure","display":"df-projector-valued — Projection-Valued Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projector-valued","aliases":["58-df-projector-valued","Projection-Valued Measure"],"display":"df-projector-valued — Projection-Valued Measure","depends_on":["[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projector-valued"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projector-valued</span><span>Projection-Valued Measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projector-valued — Projection-Valued Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,H,B\\in V\">\\(E,H,B\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(B=\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 是原三元接口中的内积函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y)\">\\(B(x,y)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a> 的五元结构接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 保留原接口。</li>\n<li>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是向量零元见证；恒等算子、零算子、部分和及其收敛均以函数图和内积不等式给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(P,H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\nP\\bigl(+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}=+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,P(x)\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,P(y)\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(P(P(x))=P(x)\n\\land B(\\langle P(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,P(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;B(\\langle P(x),P(x)\\rangle)\\leq B(\\langle x,x\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(P,H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\nP\\bigl(+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}=+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,P(x)\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,P(y)\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(P(P(x))=P(x)\n\\land B(\\langle P(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,P(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;B(\\langle P(x),P(x)\\rangle)\\leq B(\\langle x,x\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projector\\text{-}valued}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H,z,\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land z\\in H\\land\\forall u\\in H\\;\n\\bigl(+_H(\\langle z,u\\rangle)=u=+_H(\\langle u,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathcal B,H^H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land E(\\varnothing)=\\{\\langle u,z\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\n\\land E(\\mathbb R)=\\{\\langle u,u\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(E(D),H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec D\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\vec D(i)\\cap\\vec D(j)=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\exists s\\in H^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\ns(0)=z\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\ns(m+1)=+_H(\\langle s(m),E(\\vec D(m))(u)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[N\\leq m\\to\\exists v\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad v=+_H\\left(\\left\\langle E\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\vec D(j)\\right)(u),\n\\odot_H(\\langle-1,s(m)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\land B(\\langle v,v\\rangle)&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projector\\text{-}valued}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H,z,\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land z\\in H\\land\\forall u\\in H\\;\n\\bigl(+_H(\\langle z,u\\rangle)=u=+_H(\\langle u,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathcal B,H^H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land E(\\varnothing)=\\{\\langle u,z\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\n\\land E(\\mathbb R)=\\{\\langle u,u\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(E(D),H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec D\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\vec D(i)\\cap\\vec D(j)=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\exists s\\in H^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\ns(0)=z\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\ns(m+1)=+_H(\\langle s(m),E(\\vec D(m))(u)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[N\\leq m\\to\\exists v\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad v=+_H\\left(\\left\\langle E\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\vec D(j)\\right)(u),\n\\odot_H(\\langle-1,s(m)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\land B(\\langle v,v\\rangle)&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三元 PVM 接口不变。六元辅助关系中的有界性由收缩不等式明确给出；可列可加性按原来的强算子意义展开，不改为算子范数收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Titchmarsh, Eigenfunction Expansions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]] 的五元结构接口，$k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ 使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]；$\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S$ 使用 [[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ 使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]；$\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S$ 使用 [[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,H,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"B(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(P,H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,H,H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\nP\\bigl(+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}=+_H(\\langle\\odot_H(\\langle a,P(x)\\rangle),\\odot_H(\\langle b,P(y)\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(P(P(x))=P(x)\n\\land B(\\langle P(x),y\\rangle)=B(\\langle x,P(y)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;B(\\langle P(x),P(x)\\rangle)\\leq B(\\langle x,x\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projector\\text{-}valued}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H,z,\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\land z\\in H\\land\\forall u\\in H\\;\n\\bigl(+_H(\\langle z,u\\rangle)=u=+_H(\\langle u,z\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathcal B,H^H)\\\\\n&\\land E(\\varnothing)=\\{\\langle u,z\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\n\\land E(\\mathbb R)=\\{\\langle u,u\\rangle:u\\in H\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\mathrm{PvmOrthogonalProjectionData}_S(E(D),H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec D\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\ne j\\to\\vec D(i)\\cap\\vec D(j)=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\exists s\\in H^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\ns(0)=z\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\ns(m+1)=+_H(\\langle s(m),E(\\vec D(m))(u)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[N\\leq m\\to\\exists v\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad v=+_H\\left(\\left\\langle E\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\vec D(j)\\right)(u),\n\\odot_H(\\langle-1,s(m)\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\land B(\\langle v,v\\rangle)<\\varepsilon^2\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3241,"backlinks":[{"id":"d685a2bfe849b672","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)$（see [[58-df-projector-valued]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1008","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-projector-valued.md|58-df-projector-valued]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3b5b3d48ff1ff369","36d7463d215be751","b70ce791d5b1a19b"]}